```text
Connect all nodes with minimum total cost
→ MST

Cheapest path from one node to another
→ Shortest Path

Edges are given directly
→ Consider Kruskal

Adjacency list or growing from one node
→ Consider Prim

Need component checking
→ DSU

Need cheapest available connection
→ Min-Heap

Need strongest available connection
→ Max-Heap

Need all nodes connected
→ Expect V - 1 accepted edges

Need to avoid cycles
→ DSU or visited array
```

